{"overview":"مائومائو با پدر داروسازش زندگی آرامی داشت. تا اینکه یک روز او را به‌عنوان یک خدمتکار حقیر به قصر امپراتوری فروختند. اما او برای یک زندگی فرمانبرانه میان خانواده سلطنتی ساخته نشده است. بنابراین وقتی وارثان امپراتوری بیمار می‌شوند، او تصمیم می‌گیرد وارد عمل شود و درمانی پیدا کند! این کار نظر جینشی، یک مقام خوش‌سیمای قصر که او را تشویق می‌کند، جلب می‌کند. حال، او در حل معماهای پزشکی نامی برای خود دست و پا کرده است!","tagline":"","overview_en":"Maomao lived a peaceful life with her apothecary father. Until one day, she's sold as a lowly servant to the emperor's palace. But she wasn't meant for a compliant life among royalty. So when imperial heirs fall ill, she decides to step in and find a cure! This catches the eye of Jinshi, a handsome palace official who promotes her. Now, she's making a name for herself solving medical mysteries!","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":51,"y":2023,"poster":"/xwRyXCC0hcGxl45d5les3RAxz8k.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":60,"y":2023,"poster":"/phPjgVJlQfshEnc7j9Ix8GlEioK.jpg"}],"episodes":60,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"悠木碧","role":"Maomao (voice)","photo":"/a5Mkd66GV1l3c9bZZtnvjUf33T2.jpg","en":"Aoi Yuuki"},{"name":"大塚剛央","role":"Jinshi (voice)","photo":"/wqeAMR0HOGUPBXz0TCNxDR51cQy.jpg","en":"Takeo Otsuka"},{"name":"کاتسویوکی کونیشی","role":"Gaoshun (voice)","photo":"/nYM5cH6U7cp4x9dIzW0enmEKmeV.jpg","en":"Katsuyuki Konishi"}],"trailer":"3lfb_KeqdEM","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/220542/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Netflix","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/rK1KljqmbvO9HQa1PBFLILWah72.png"},{"n":"Hulu","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/44uAnmSqvA4yBOdbPWN8YgQHjWm.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"Netflix Standard with Ads","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/eGUwOOIxcazwEBxqJpSN5sWEu6